    "summary": "Friendly **FOETID BLOAT-DRONE** units, **FOETID BLOAT-DRONE WITH HEAVY BLIGHT LAUNCHER** units, **HELBRUTE** units and **MYPHITIC BLIGHT-HAULER** units gain the **CONTAGION ENGINE** keyword. Ranged attacks made by friendly **CONTAGION ENGINE** units have **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)**. The detachment carries the **ENGINES** tag, so no other **ENGINES** detachment can be taken alongside it.",
